\\\"conditions\\\":\\\"Hazelnuts have been directly observed nearby, but their nutrition and toxicity remain unknown. A single sample is being collected. Roots and red berries are already known safe. Appearance alone must not certify safety.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":\\\"An owned unfamiliar food sample; any other required materials or prerequisites must be specified rather than granted.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Method, time, energy, sample consumption and equipment requirements are unknown; disclose them before testing.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"Provide a reusable testing interface only if a real supported method exists. Record only properties actually established by a physical trial, with limitations. If unsupported, report the missing mechanism; do not invent safety, nutrition or resources.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The hazelnut observation established visible stock and growing conditions, not edibility.\\\",\\\"Keep unfamiliar hazelnuts separate from known-safe meals; no consumption test is planned.\\\",\\\"Existing root and berry reserves make further bulk harvesting unnecessary now.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Prefer informative, bounded trials over consuming unknown foods or using interfaces that explicitly lack the desired effect.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"local-food-evidence\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"What nearby food reserves can be used safely, and what remains unknown about them?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"At tick 25, inventory contains four roots and five berries.\\\",\\\"Personal knowledge lists root nutrition 14 and berry nutrition 8, both with toxicity 0.\\\",\\\"Direct observation at tick 25 recorded five hazelnuts at the nearby mature plant and ordinary local soil conditions.\\\",\\\"The starting root and berry sources currently show zero stock; another visible berry source holds twelve units.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Hazelnut nutrition and toxicity remain unknown; visible state is not a food-safety test.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Maintain known-safe food reserves and identify a supported way to assess unfamiliar foods.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Collected known-safe roots and berries.\\\",\\\"Directly observed the nearby hazelnut source.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Personal record of the hazelnut source's visible state at tick 25.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A supported physical method for determining unfamiliar-food nutrition and toxicity.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Recover energy, collect one hazelnut sample, and request a bounded assessment method with explicit limitations.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Known-safe food is held in inventory; the hazelnut observation documents local availability but provides no safety assurance.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"def24011-0d6a-4882-b848-894700bc188a","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["section","search","ids","offset","part"],"properties":{"section":{"type":"string","enum":["abilities","inventory","knowledge","projects","memory","state","observed"]},"search":{"type":"string","maxLength":400},"ids":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"string","maxLength":240}},"offset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"part":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}}}},"result_json":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"strict":true},"verbosity":"medium"},"top_p":0.98,"top_logprobs":0,"temperature":1.0,"reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","summary":null,"mode":"standard"},"user":n